supralinux-icons (1.3.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Use the Breeze index.theme directory metadata instead of declaring every
    directory as fixed. At sizes such as 48 px the loader could not use a
    fixed 32 px directory and fell back to monochrome icons from another
    theme.
  * Keep Breeze's GTK-only 24 px directories out of the index and declare the
    SupraLINUX start-here and kickoff branding directories as extras.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0000

supralinux-icons (1.3.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial complete SupraLINUX icon themes based on Breeze and Breeze Dark.
  * Materialize the cross-theme Breeze links so both themes are complete and
    independent: no icon points outside its own theme.
  * Declare every icon directory in index.theme, including the 24 px and
    scaled directories that Breeze leaves undeclared.
  * Use the SupraLINUX color logo for start-here and kickoff aliases.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <packages@supralinux.invalid>  Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:00:00 +0000
